Train generator+discriminator against a frozen classifier

<BIN> train [OPTIONS]

OPTIONS:
  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit
          --classifier TEXT REQUIRED 
                              Trained classifier (frozen signal source)
          --dataset TEXT:DIR REQUIRED 
                              Training images root (subdirs 0..9 of PNGs)

Network paths:
          --generator TEXT [generator.wgt]  
                              Generator save path (created if missing)
          --discriminator TEXT [discriminator.wgt]  
                              Discriminator save path (created if missing)

Topology:
          --latent-dim UINT [100]  
                              Noise vector size fed to generator
          --gen-layers UINT [[256,512]]  ... 
                              Generator hidden layer sizes (new network only)
          --disc-layers UINT [[512,256]]  ... 
                              Discriminator hidden layer sizes (new network only)
          --dataset-img-width UINT [28]  
                              Width of test images in pixels.
          --dataset-img-height UINT [28]  
                              Height of test images in pixels.

GAN training:
          --gen-lr FLOAT [0.0002]  
                              Generator learning rate
          --disc-lr FLOAT [0.0001]  
                              Discriminator learning rate
          --epochs UINT [300]  
                              Total epochs
          --batch-size UINT [64]  
                              Samples per batch
          --disc-steps UINT [3]  
                              Discriminator updates per generator update
          --dropout FLOAT [0.3]  
                              Discriminator dropout rate
          --classifier-weight FLOAT [1]  
                              Weight of classifier loss in generator update
          --dataset-limit UINT [0]  
                              Max images per label to load (0 = all)

Adaptive learning rate:
          --adaptive-lr       Enable adaptive lr adjustment
          --lr-ema-alpha FLOAT [0.9]  
                              EMA smoothing factor; higher = slower reaction
          --d-real-target-low FLOAT [0.3]  
                              D(real) below this => D collapsed
          --d-real-target-high FLOAT [0.8]  
                              D(real) above this => D dominating
          --gen-fool-target-low FLOAT [0.3]  
                              D(G(z)) below this => D dominating/collapsed
          --gen-fool-target-high FLOAT [0.6]  
                              D(G(z)) above this => G dominating
          --lr-adjust-factor FLOAT [1.05]  
                              Multiplicative lr step per epoch
          --lr-min FLOAT [1e-06]  
                              Lower lr clamp
          --lr-max FLOAT [0.01]  
                              Upper lr clamp
          --lr-warmup-epochs UINT [5]  
                              Epochs before adaptive adjustments begin

Flatness detection:
          --flatness-detection 
                              Enable plateau detection
          --flatness-threshold FLOAT [0.005]  
                              Max EMA change per epoch to count as flat
          --flatness-window UINT [10]  
                              Consecutive flat epochs before kick fires
          --flatness-kick-duration UINT [5]  
                              Epochs to hold the kick
          --flatness-dropout-boost FLOAT [2]  
                              Multiply D dropout by this during kick
          --flatness-gen-lr-boost FLOAT [3]  
                              Multiply G lr by this during kick
